ra2-r2cnrifle-name = Combined Arms Rifleman
ra2-r2cnrifle-description = Affordable line infantry.
    Network support improves sustained fire.
    Strong vs infantry; vulnerable to armor and splash damage.

ra2-r2cnportable-name = Portable Missile Team
ra2-r2cnportable-description = Deploy to switch between anti-tank and anti-air modes.
    Cannot engage both at once; weak against infantry.
    AT mode starts active.

ra2-r2cnnetwork-name = Network Technician
ra2-r2cnnetwork-description = Deploy: networked allies within 6 cells get shorter reloads.
    Reload time reduced by 15%; bonuses do not stack.
    Detects cloaked targets. Moving retracts the fragile relay.

ra2-r2redspear-name = Red Spear
ra2-r2redspear-description = Elite rifle specialist and mobile four-cell network relay.
    Detects concealed infantry; limited to one.
    Strong vs infantry; needs anti-armor support.

ra2-r2zbd-name = Sea Dragon IFV
ra2-r2zbd-description = Amphibious carrier: four infantry and an autocannon.
    Strong vs infantry/light vehicles; weak vs tanks and air.
    Cross water and unload on shore.

ra2-r2phl-name = Longbow Rocket Artillery
ra2-r2phl-description = Six-rocket barrage against clustered ground targets.
    Twelve-cell range, four-cell minimum range, long reload.
    Fragile; keep behind a protected frontline.

ra2-r2skyspear-name = Skyspear Interceptor
ra2-r2skyspear-description = Fast air-superiority fighter with four missiles.
    Returns to an airfield to rearm.
    Air targets only; vulnerable while grounded.

ra2-r2crane-name = Crane Airlift
ra2-r2crane-description = Carries six infantry with a defensive machine gun.
    Land and unload near the objective.
    Visible on radar and vulnerable to anti-air.

ra2-r2luyang-name = Luyang Destroyer
ra2-r2luyang-description = Fleet anchor with naval gun and anti-submarine torpedoes.
    Detects submerged targets within six cells.
    Requires an anti-air escort.

ra2-r2haiwang-name = Haiwang Drone Carrier
ra2-r2haiwang-description = Launches three strike drones that return and replenish.
    Long-range pressure against tanks and structures.
    Slow and defenseless against submarines or aircraft.

ra2-r2haiying-name = Haiying Missile Corvette
ra2-r2haiying-description = Fast coastal missile ship and fleet anti-air escort.
    Strong vs aircraft and exposed ships.
    Light armor; cannot attack submerged targets.

ra2-r2kunlun-name = Kunlun Landing Ship
ra2-r2kunlun-description = Heavy amphibious transport for infantry and vehicles.
    Sixteen cargo capacity; unloads on land.
    Unarmed and slow: escort before crossing.

ra2-r2jiaolong-name = Jiaolong Submarine
ra2-r2jiaolong-description = Fast submerged torpedo attacker.
    Hunts ships and enemy submarines.
    Cannot attack land or aircraft; countered by sonar and ASW.

ra2-r2bastion-name = Bastion Autocannon
ra2-r2bastion-description = Twin autocannon defense against infantry and light vehicles.
    Benefits from network targeting.
    Requires power; weak vs heavy armor and aircraft.

ra2-r2skyshield-name = Skyshield Battery
ra2-r2skyshield-description = Dedicated eleven-cell anti-air defense.
    Benefits from network targeting.
    Requires power; cannot attack ground targets.

ra2-r2spectrum-name = Spectrum Relay
ra2-r2spectrum-description = Powered seven-cell targeting and detection relay.
    Jams 30% of nearby hostile missiles within five cells.
    Unarmed and fragile; shells and infantry bypass its jammer.
